---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  slug="notifications"
  title="Notifications"
  description="Get pinged in Slack or by email when a build finishes."
>
  <h2 id="slack">Slack</h2>
  <p>
    Paste an incoming webhook URL into the project's Notifications settings, choose which events
    to send, and save. A "Send test message" action confirms the webhook works before you rely on
    it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="email">Email</h2>
  <p>
    Email notifications go out for failed builds by default, using the address on your account —
    no extra configuration needed.
  </p>

  <h2 id="events">Events</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Build started</li>
    <li>Build succeeded</li>
    <li>Build failed</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
